{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/360256-ctd-duchy-of-the-sunshine-coast","id":360256,"title":"CTD Duchy of the Sunshine Coast","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-05T09:59:59-08:00","id":360256,"title":"CTD Duchy of the Sunshine Coast","content":"Hi I'm long time fan of CTD RPG setting, now I'm happy that your going to make a new version of the CTD RPG, Now in the original setting there was the Duchy of the Golden Gate, well I would like official create for the new CTD setting what I want to create is the Duchy of Sunshine Coast in the Kingdom of Northern Ice. This Duchy covers BC and is based in the Sunshine Coast area of BC<br /> <br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T16:53:36-08:00","id":360752,"title":"","content":"I am confused by what you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T17:14:28-08:00","id":360767,"title":"","content":"Like Lian, I have no clue what you are trying to say or ask. Would it be possible to clarify your post?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:03:18-08:00","id":361815,"title":"","content":"The way I interpret the post is LIKE the Dutchy of the Golden Gate, or using the Dutch otGG as a template, our friend Martian 1912 would like to create The Duchy of the Sunshine Coast which would be located in the Kingdom of Northern Ice. It would cover the geography of British Columbia known as the Sunshine Coast.<br /> <br /> I think it's a fantastic idea Martain. I'd love to see how you develop that. Maybe the Onyx Path crew will take you up on writing for that. As far as I know, there's still an Open Call out for writers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T12:34:47-08:00","id":818641,"title":"","content":"Changeling the Dreaming RPG, I want to create an official Dutchy Sunshine Coast is were I live, Officially there was Red Cap that ended becoming a Baron due to using his Teeth in craving an Ice statue, <br /> <br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T18:42:37-08:00","id":818908,"title":"","content":"You want to write it up and submit it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T05:18:52-08:00","id":819136,"title":"","content":"I hope this doesn't come off as rude, but I'm guessing English isn't your first language? I'm not sure your written English is quite strong enough for publication at the moment, based on your posts here. There's a slight clunkiness of syntax that native speakers would notice straight away. I would focus on that first, or consider getting an English-speaking friend to do the relevant translation. Then double check everything before submission to avoid any last minute errors. <br /> <br /> There's nothing stopping you from writing fan material in your native tongue either. That might be a better idea to begin with, and then you can publish it on your own site. It allows you to practice.<br /> <br /> Good luck!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T15:00:15-08:00","id":819993,"title":"","content":"I've got Aspergers and English is my Mother language, <br /> <br /> <br /> On the Subject of my Dutchy of the Sunshine Coast, the Seelie Court is based in Victoria BC, Unseelie Court Vancouver. Now there are Two Old WOD sourcebooks that will effect my Dutchy the Vancouver source book and the Mage A Syndicate source book. <br /> <br /> Since they are rebooting the Old WOD what about Vancouver and BC which the Dutchy covers.<br /> <br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T10:43:11-08:00","id":820431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Martian1912</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/360256-ctd-duchy-of-the-sunshine-coast?p=819993#post819993\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got Aspergers and English is my Mother language, <br /> <br /> <br /> On the Subject of my Dutchy of the Sunshine Coast, the Seelie Court is based in Victoria BC, Unseelie Court Vancouver. Now there are Two Old WOD sourcebooks that will effect my Dutchy the Vancouver source book and the Mage A Syndicate source book. <br /> <br /> Since they are rebooting the Old WOD what about Vancouver and BC which the Dutchy covers.<br /> <br /> <br /> LW</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry. Your first couple of posts were difficult to parse. I hope I didn't offend you.<br /> <br /> Have you read the submission guidelines? The best thing to do, I guess, would be to write some sample text (they ask for fluff and crunch), fill in a waiver form, and submit it. Then they'll get back in touch. I think they'd be more likely to hire a new writer to contribute to an existing project first, before commissioning a brand new project. But it's worth pitching the idea anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T10:02:39-07:00","id":881066,"title":"","content":"I still want to create this Dutchy but have they oficial rebooted Changeling yet?,<br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T07:46:36-07:00","id":881778,"title":"","content":"There is no &quot;reboot&quot; with C20, just a new edition with setting updates and what looks like a mechanical overhaul. There's been talk of the new White Wolf Publishing, a separate entity from Onyx Path which is publishing C20, doing some sort of reboot to the WoD lines as they develop 4th edition but nothing is concrete and in any case it will likely be at least several years before they make it down the list to Changeling.<br /> <br /> If you want to write up your Duchy there's nothing stopping you. I'm sure a lot of here would love to read it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-04T02:27:18-08:00","id":1011915,"title":"","content":"But I want it official Fae Dutchy in the Kingdom of Ice, also which Vancouver is that Changeling we comic based in?,<br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-04T02:34:08-08:00","id":1011916,"title":"","content":"Well the reason I wanted to do this is that Victoria dispight being the Capital of BC Victoria feels like a small town that gives off power of largest cities in Canada, this would be due to the Duke having his Selie Court here,<br /> <br /> Also I wanted to update Vancouver since the source book,<br /> <br /> also that Changeling Web Comic which Vancouver is it in?,<br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-05T17:20:19-08:00","id":1012881,"title":"","content":"Hi Martian1912, at the moment, they are updating Changeling the dreaming rule systems and regrouping information on kiths and powers, mostly. They are not currently working on updating locations source books.<br /> <br /> What Changeling web comic were you referring to?<br /> <br /> (Also, to the writers or regulars, if I made any mistakes, please feel free to correct me).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12678-monkeydjie","name":"Monkeydjie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T22:21:11-08:00","id":1033158,"title":"","content":"Well the Changeling comic that mention on this forum, Secondly I still would like to Official create this Dutchy of Sunshine Coast in the Kingdom of Northern Ice, yes I know that Old WOD Official has bin Rebooted but I've bin using the old WOD source books to create this Dutchy. such as Vancouver one.<br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T00:47:30-08:00","id":1033209,"title":"","content":"The only Changeling webcomic I'm aware of is <a href=\"http://chrysalis.thecomicseries.com/comics/1/\" target=\"_blank\">Chrysalys</a>.<br /> <br /> So what comic are you talking about?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T06:22:37-08:00","id":1033304,"title":"","content":"They're probably talking about Black City Birds, since it's set in Vancouver: <a href=\"https://tapastic.com/series/Black-city-Birds\" target=\"_blank\">https://tapastic.com/series/Black-city-Birds</a><br /> <br /> It's also a fan comic and not an official publication from Onyx Path or White Wolf (albeit one I enjoy greatly), so I'm not sure why it would affect any potential pitches or submissions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T08:45:49-08:00","id":1033387,"title":"","content":"The setting section has quite a lot of information about the world, including some new stuff.<br /> <br /> But honestly, I couldn't get Newfoundland in the book as one of the writers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":3785,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","user":"Luka C","date":". 01-17-2017, 12:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","name":"Luka C","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3785_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-23T08:44:24-08:00","id":1036657,"title":"","content":"Well will the Dutchy just cover the Sunshine Coast or all of B.C., also in the Changeling 20 is the Vancouver Cassio still around and the sleeping monster still in Victoria, The Dutchy is story of Two noble Street Knights one from Unicorn house and one from House Falcon, both of them were as good as Sir Cronos, <br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T15:18:37-07:00","id":1151126,"title":"","content":"Still would like my idea for this Duchy Of Sunshine Coast officially in the New Old WOD Changeling rpg setting,<br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T15:58:55-07:00","id":1151140,"title":"","content":"Here are Onyx Path\u2019s submission guidelines:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\"> Page not found &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Your best bet for getting picked up as a freelance writer is to follow the directions there. Keep in mind though that there\u2019s no guarantee a book will come up on the schedule that will call for a Duchy of the Sunshine Coast write-up. As I understand it, location books tend to be poor sellers. Even if a book calls for detailing the Duchy of the Sunshine Coast and you get tapped to write it, there\u2019s still no guarantee that the vision of the Duchy of the Sunshine Coast you have in your head right now will be what\u2019s called for in the book. You need to be flexible as a freelancer. Your work has to harmonize with what the other writers are doing and what the developer is trying to put together. There might be something you write that you\u2019re really attached to but must change to fit with the rest of the book.<br /> <br /> Honestly, from the sound of what you\u2019re wanting, you\u2019ll probably be best served by doing a fan book on the Duchy of the Sunshine Coast. When the Storyteller\u2019s Vault opens up for Changeling: The Dreaming material, you can polish your work and/or get with someone you knows layout to sell your Duchy of the Sunshine Coast sourcebook through there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 10-19-2017, 07:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-24T01:03:53-08:00","id":1162119,"title":"","content":"Well I got the PDF of the Changeling RPG 20th version, and it layed out the current setting and Glamour now being hard to find and Banality on the rise, and High King David back but as a broken King no Winter King.<br /> <br /> Well I would like to due some official Changeling fiction that feaured my Duchy it will about the robbery of the Maple Leaf shaped Casino in Vancouver, a Fae version of Ocean 11 the original not the remakes.<br /> <br /> LW<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}